Buce
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
GOUX 2 FACE_HALF
GOUX 0 FACE_HALF
GOUX 1 FACE_HALF
GOUX 10 FACE_HALF
GOUX 10 FACE_HALF
GOUX 3 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE GOUX GOUX
AND
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit match
        DEST Suit {HEARTS}
    OR
        DEST Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS, SPADES, DIAMONDS}
        SRC Rank K
MOVE_STACK GOUX GOUX
SRCSTACK Rank descending
$win
AND
    PILE ALL GOUX Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL GOUX Empty
        PILE ALL GOUX Empty
